  "description": "HPC is proud to introduce the BEST value high performance enduro bike! We are now offering a frame kit on our most popular bike to offer builders the ability to make it their own.\n\nThis full carbon trail bike is our first all new full suspension bike in 3 years, and we are beyond excited to share this bike with you. During frame development, we worked with DVO Suspension to refine kinematics and maximize suspension performance with full custom factory tunes on both the front fork and rear shock. This is a true lightweight, high performance machine that will please the serious trail rider to the mild mannered adventure seeker. People have been asking for a bike like this from us for a long time, and we are proud to finally deliver after 2 years of development and testing.\n\nImagine having a bike with up to 2X the power and torque of any of the mainstream big box brands, up to a 910Wh 52V USA made battery pack built into the frame that provides up to 45 miles of range, and an incredibly plush 160mm of factory tuned suspension travel. Well, dream no more, the wait is finally over!\n\nNot only does this bike have torque sensing pedal assist, but is extremely unique in its ability to use a thumb throttle as well to take over power delivery on demand\n\nOptimized for a 160mm travel fork and 155mm rear frame travel, this is a do it all type of bike you can rely on for rugged and reliable trail duty for years to come. A refined, ultra light weight chassis allows the Trailblazer to come in at a staggeringly low 51 lbs including the battery system for the base 750W version.",
